    <string name="settings_accuracy">Accuracy limit</string>
    <string name="settings_accuracy_explanation">Fixes less certain than this are ignored. Lower keeps out the wandering a phone does indoors; too low and a wooded valley records nothing. Read when a recording starts.</string>

